                "text": "Today, I was proud to celebrate Lubbock\u2019s own UMC Emergency Medical Services Team for 50 years of unparalleled service to our community!\u2028\u2028For the last five decades, West Texas has been fortunate to have the highest level of healthcare and emergency response professionals protecting our families thanks to UMC EMS - one of just 46 EMS systems worldwide with dual accreditation and winner of the American Heat Association\u2019s Mission Lifetime Gold Award every year since 2019.\u2028\u2028Congratulations on an exception 50 years, here\u2019s to 50 more!",
