                "text": "This was just six years ago when Democrats went all in on free healthcare for illegal immigrants, and they\u2019ve only gotten more radical. \n\nNow they want to spend $1.5 trillion on health care for illegal immigrants and welfare for those who refuse to work while veterans, taxpayers, and our economy suffer.",
