                "text": "Translation: Democrats are intentionally making families suffer in order to reinstate welfare without work, taxpayer funded health care for illegals, and fraudulent, COVID-era Obamacare subsidies for those making over half a million dollars a year.\n\nBut this isn't new for Democrats. Their policies lit the fuse on the current immigration and inflation crises under which our families are still suffering.",
