                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Years of government intervention created the health care mess we find ourselves in, and the answer isn\u2019t another government program. The answer is less government, more competition, and giving patients the freedom to shop for higher-quality, lower-cost care.\n\nWe need to be honest with the American people, and if we can\u2019t do this with Democrats, we should use reconciliation to finally secure health care reforms that actually bring down the cost of care.",
