                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Republicans are delivering the America First agenda \u2014 reining in out-of-control spending, reigniting our economy for families and small businesses, securing the border, rooting out waste and fraud in Washington, and tackling the soaring health care costs created by the Unaffordable Care Act.\n\nMeanwhile, Democrats tried to launch ANOTHER baseless impeachment against President Trump. Remember, this is the same party that shut down the government for 43 days to demand free health care for illegal immigrants.\n\nWhile Republicans stay focused on results, Democrats remain fixated on political theater. With the midterms approaching, the contrast in leadership and priorities couldn\u2019t be clearer.",
