                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Republicans are bringing forward health care reforms that will actually lower costs. According to the Congressional Budget Office, our bill will reduce premiums by 11%!\n\nMeanwhile, Democrats are pushing a COVID-era, fraud-ridden subsidy that perpetuates a failed system that year after year raises premiums and deductibles. \n\nI spoke on the House floor to show the American people the solution that delivers real affordability and choice, not more government failure.",
